              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi konyou, kolot Sarapet: ido nakedolio orute loka ere, koany, koiai apuserut erarai akito; konyarau ŋes, kobala ebe, “Kenainait koomikinai adisikipi kibore, kamat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye napelosi aomare, konyarau ŋes, kobala ebe, “Kenainait, koinunai idionyamat kakanikon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
