        {
          "text": " Kobala ŋesi ebe, “Kwape ejaria EJAKAIT Ekonideke, emameete eoŋ inyamat, dimarai ikiria adiopekan ejaas amot, ka idiokinyet katany; ido koany, edepuni akito aarei, kaloma kepou eoŋ ka ikakoku, kanyama, kedenyiata atwakare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
