        {
          "text": " Kotema Eliya atiar, “Sirikiyoŋ; kolot kiswama kwape ibalar; konye kogeu ber aipoikin eoŋ idionyamat koinu, kokau kipou ijo alopet ka ikonikoku, ",
          "type": "text",
