          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai ebala kwanata EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael ebe, ‘Mam inonar amot naka akiria, karaida akinyet nakatany mam edaun, aitodol apaaran naisitepia EJAKAIT akiru akwap.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
