              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodaku Eliya ikoku, kiiesunor kagola koyau togo, koinak totoke: kotema Eliya atiar. “Koany, ejari do okokukon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.23",
